{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mutual generation and restraint of military units to lay the foundation for victory, employ the brave tactics of military generals to reverse the declining trend, rely on the ingenious power of siege weapons to blast open city walls, and make good use of the undulating terrain to suppress powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/cd8229f7edc63d7146b47931b7bd0168.poster.avif?t=1758175919\" width=864 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/cd8229f7edc63d7146b47931b7bd0168.webm?t=1758175919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/cd8229f7edc63d7146b47931b7bd0168.mp4?t=1758175919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Generals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit these historical famous generals one by one under your command. Visiting talents and employing renowned scholars is the main theme for surviving in troubled times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/ae2e4ed941eb843293c508845d5c882e.poster.avif?t=1758175919\" width=864 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/ae2e4ed941eb843293c508845d5c882e.webm?t=1758175919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/ae2e4ed941eb843293c508845d5c882e.mp4?t=1758175919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In troubled times, stockpiling ample grain, building high walls, developing quietly, and accumulating steadily to strike effectively are excellent means of survival. Through internal affairs buildings and technological research, you can make your force take a commanding lead among the warlords of the Three Kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/82af9615ade8352dc2c09f2ae54cb041.poster.avif?t=1758175919\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/82af9615ade8352dc2c09f2ae54cb041.webm?t=1758175919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Romance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete different Romance branches and choose various event paths to make the course of history unpredictable.ZhugeLiang\u2019s grand Northern Expedition plan and the restoration of the old capital are no longer just dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/57fb9b4e6e09c4e697cac689cc57944a.poster.avif?t=1758175919\" width=864 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/57fb9b4e6e09c4e697cac689cc57944a.webm?t=1758175919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001430/extras/57fb9b4e6e09c4e697cac689cc57944a.mp4?t=1758175919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001430?t=1758175919","background_raw":"https://shared.